  "full_text": "Okay, so getting spaghetti. I got a plan. So I used to eat a full can of Chef Boyardee as a meal. Yep. Mom's talking to the dog. She gets the dog excited. I like him. I don't have any use for long noodles. It's just right now. Okay, so like we're gonna it's gonna be my new 7-7-7 for 50% power. That's my new cook strategy I'm gonna tinker with it till I get it perfect. So these noodles are kind of like flat weird. Oh No It totally depends on what kind of noodles you're using. So, like, if you get one brand or another brand... Fuck. Didn't think about that. So, uh, yeah, I'm gonna, like, tinker with it, get it perfect. Then I'll be the noodle meister. So, uh... Let's see what Mr. God says. Okay, this is... I'm worried about copyrights. Just because, like, the Jews are real crazy. about the law you know what i'm saying like the jews like the the real serious jews you know they like they like they really obsess on the law so if i'm going to be worthy to make the temple then i better like respect copyright because like well because jews you know i was ready to respond to those who asked me not to be found by those who sought me i said here i am here i am to a nation that did not call upon my name. I have stretched out my hands all the day to a rebellious people who walk in evil paths and follow their own thoughts, people who provoke me continually to my face, offering sacrifices in the groves and burning incense on bricks, living among the graves and spending the night in caverns, eating swine's flesh with carrion broth in their dishes, crying out, Hold back!",
